    "detailed_description": "<strong>The war against AI has wiped out most of humanity. The last survivors are living in earth's orbit, until a rogue system assigns a task to a certain pilot...</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A new generation of ARPG</h2>RUTHLESS:1 enhances classic ARPG gameplay by offering you a wide variety of Mechs to control. Assemble a squad of up to three Mechs, carrying up to five weapons, skills and buffs, allowing you respond to threats immediately.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sci-fi creature collecting</h2>Assume control of 100 different Mechs. Fight enemies, loot their system cores, rebuild them as your own, or simply upgrade the ones you have. Whether you need melee or long-range, crowd control or single-target shots. You name it, you get it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hack and Slash</h2>Wreak mayhem as you battle your way through hordes over hordes of enemies. The fast-paced, battle-focused gameplay grants an experience, that leaves no room for boredom.",
